  "contentHtml": "<div><div class=\"txc-textbox\" style=\"padding: 10px; border: 3px double rgb(254, 137, 67); border-image: none; background-color: rgb(254, 222, 199);\"><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">&lt;재미있는 과학수업 만들기&gt;의 수업관련자료들은 선생님들의 '협업'을 위해 공유되고 있습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"line-height: 25.6px; font-size: 11pt;\">수업을 위한 자료로만 사용해주시기 바랍니다.&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 19.2px;\"><b><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 11pt;\">** '말머리' 에서 해당단원을 선택해주세요.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6; font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">수업자료를 찾기 쉬워집니다.**</span></span></b></p></div><p>2015개정교육과정으로 첫 1학년 수업을 어떻게 시작할까...고민하다가</p><p>딱딱한 1단원(지권의 변화)보다는 말랑한 단원(생물의 다양성)이 낫겠다 싶어서</p><p>부랴부랴 수업자료를 찾던 중,</p><p>혹시나 다른 선생님들께 도움이 될까 싶어서 자료를 올려봅니다.</p><p>저도 예전에 어디선가 다운을 받은 겁니다.</p><p><br></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 140%; letter-spacing: 0pt; -ms-text-autospace:; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">2010 </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">생물다양성의 해 기념</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">(www.biodiversity2010.net)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 140%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 20pt; -ms-text-autospace:; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 20pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>교</strong></span></span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\"><strong>실에서 만나는 생물다양성</strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 140%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 25pt; font-weight: bold; -ms-text-autospace:; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 돋움; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움;\">중학교 교사용 자료</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 100%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5pt; -ms-text-autospace:; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-fareast-font-family: HY중고딕;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-fareast-font-family: HY중고딕;\"><!--[endif]-->&nbsp; </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 100%; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 32pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5pt; -ms-text-autospace:; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">「</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; mso-font-width: 100%; ms